    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d722-a7">

                <pb facs="1157" n="1061" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg1061"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <p>As is easy to perceive, neither Santa Rosa nor Quesada figures in this list,
                    which leads us to suppose that there are in it many fictitious names of persons
                    of more importance.</p>
                <p>Neither are the names of the crew included. The list comprises names only of the
                    passengers who came to swell the ranks of the insurrection.</p>
                <p>From the “Voz de Cuba,” (extra.)</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Havana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-11-07"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 7,
                        1873</date>.</dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
